      "description": "Two different failures. Lost never arrived and could not be retransmitted in time: the network, or a receive path that cannot keep up. Dropped arrived too late for the latency window, which usually means the window is too small for the link. Per stream, these are on GET /api/live; this is the pod's total."
    },
