      "description": "What never reached libsrt at all, so no per-socket figure can see it. This is the collapse itself: the 250-stream baseline hit 319,000 of these in fifteen seconds while every stream still reported itself healthy. Zero on a quiet pod. Anything sustained here means this pod is past its knee whatever the stream count says. Linux only."
    },
